# Step 9

Configure Prometheus

Edit

```bash
sudo nano /opt/prometheus/prometheus.yml
```

Add

```yaml
- job_name: "kube-state-metrics"

  static_configs:
    - targets:
        - "172.31.45.28:30081"
```

Restart

```bash
sudo systemctl restart prometheus
```

